      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "A huge thank you to everyone at Capacity Electrical. They were the only company I spoke with that was willing to come out to talk in person and take the time to understand our needs. What really stood out to me was when we were talking about installing the inverter in the garage. I made a comment about how i had seen some really ugly inverter installations when we were househunting, but I guess it didn't matter if it's hidden in a garage. Ross responded that he would never cut corners like that, even where it wouldn't be seen - and the inverter and any cabling would be neat and tidy (see the photo, it looks great!).After he visited, Kerrin and Ross put together several great choices which was then followed by 20+ emails from me over several weeks asking all sorts of questions. Each email was answered thoroughly and I never once felt like I was being brushed off or any of my concerns being glossed over.Throughout the installation Ross and his team were punctual, friendly and happy to explain what they were doing and kept me updated when anything minor cropped up. They cleaned up after themselves as they went and at the end of each day the site was tidy and safe. The inspector was booked for the final day and everything approved. Ross gave us a full rundown on everything we needed to know about using the system. He arranged everything with the power company once the inspectors report came through and finished up by sending us photos and full user manual.I couldn't be happier with how the whole process and the service provided at every stage. The panels and rails look fantastic and everything is neat and tidy. I even got up into the roof space and all cabling there is neat and tidy too. Capacity Electrical isn't a business with fancy salespeople and dozens of contractors, they're a small business focused on delivering quality and that's exactly what they delivered. I highly recommend them.",
