      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Ross and his team did a fantastic job in every respect.We’ve been cautious about getting solar panels ever since a bad experience with another company many years ago. I’m pleased to say that Capacity Electrical have managed to restore my faith in the industry.The advice provided was spot on, they didn’t try to make us spend money on things we didn’t really need and demonstrated themselves to be honest and responsible as a company and as individuals.They were punctual, reliable, tidy, friendly and professional with everything they did. They worked efficiently and effectively and had the system installed quicker than expected.Ross has followed up with after installation contact to make sure everything was working as it should and that we were clear on all the details. He even sent a thank you card in the mail to thank us for choosing his company.I have dealt with scores of companies for various products and services, there are only three that I’d give 5 Star ratings in every category and Capacity Electrical is one of those companies.",
